+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5k-record store, the measured SessionStart hook p50 was **11.9 ms** before `quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that change, the measured p50 was **1.05 ms**. The latter measurement includes the `fts_rows` counter and the body `CHECK`, which were added at the same time.
+
+| Configuration | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Live `quick_check` on the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| Recorded integrity off the read path, with `fts_rows` counter and body `CHECK` | 1.05 ms |
